{"4057270": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Truck Simulator 2026: USA", "steam_appid": 4057270, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057270/extras/db9d2c3af341014437a06a29db97bfc0.poster.avif?t=1781620888\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057270/extras/db9d2c3af341014437a06a29db97bfc0.webm?t=1781620888\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057270/extras/db9d2c3af341014437a06a29db97bfc0.mp4?t=1781620888\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Welcome to the Trucker’s Life</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the true spirit of American trucking in <strong>Truck Simulator 2026: USA</strong>. Start as a rookie driver and rise to the top, building your own logistics empire while conquering thousands of miles of scenic U.S. highways.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Vast and Living America 🌄</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore iconic routes from the East Coast to the Wild West: from neon-lit cities to desert highways and rugged mountain roads. Every mile is a challenge that tests your skill and endurance behind the wheel.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Realistic Trucks, Detailed Design 🛠️</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get behind the wheel of highly detailed trucks with carefully crafted interiors and exteriors. Customize cabins, paint jobs, and accessories to build the perfect ride that matches your personal style.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Haul Anything, Master Everything 📦</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deliver a wide range of cargo — from fragile goods to heavy machinery and hazardous materials. Manage fuel, maintenance, and realistic driving systems for an authentic trucking experience.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build Your Own Empire 💼</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn, invest, and expand your business. Hire drivers, grow your fleet, and become the ultimate transport tycoon. Every road leads to your success in <strong>Truck Simulator 2026: USA</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057270/extras/507d289d7b898205d42287ffaef86829.poster.avif?t=1781620888\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057270/extras/507d289d7b898205d42287ffaef86829.webm?t=1781620888\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057270/extras/507d289d7b898205d42287ffaef86829.mp4?t=1781620888\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057270/extras/db9d2c3af341014437a06a29db97bfc0.poster.avif?t=1781620888\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057270/extras/db9d2c3af341014437a06a29db97bfc0.webm?t=1781620888\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057270/extras/db9d2c3af341014437a06a29db97bfc0.mp4?t=1781620888\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Welcome to the Trucker’s Life</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the true spirit of American trucking in <strong>Truck Simulator 2026: USA</strong>. Start as a rookie driver and rise to the top, building your own logistics empire while conquering thousands of miles of scenic U.S. highways.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Vast and Living America 🌄</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore iconic routes from the East Coast to the Wild West: from neon-lit cities to desert highways and rugged mountain roads. Every mile is a challenge that tests your skill and endurance behind the wheel.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Realistic Trucks, Detailed Design 🛠️</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get behind the wheel of highly detailed trucks with carefully crafted interiors and exteriors. Customize cabins, paint jobs, and accessories to build the perfect ride that matches your personal style.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Haul Anything, Master Everything 📦</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deliver a wide range of cargo — from fragile goods to heavy machinery and hazardous materials. Manage fuel, maintenance, and realistic driving systems for an authentic trucking experience.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build Your Own Empire 💼</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn, invest, and expand your business. Hire drivers, grow your fleet, and become the ultimate transport tycoon. Every road leads to your success in <strong>Truck Simulator 2026: USA</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057270/extras/507d289d7b898205d42287ffaef86829.poster.avif?t=1781620888\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057270/extras/507d289d7b898205d42287ffaef86829.webm?t=1781620888\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057270/extras/507d289d7b898205d42287ffaef86829.mp4?t=1781620888\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "Step into the driver’s seat in Truck Simulator 2026: USA! 🚚 Haul cargo across iconic American highways, drive trucks, customize your rig, and build your own transport empire from coast to coast! 🌎", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><